---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Arrow from '../components/Arrow.astro';
import ContactClose from '../components/ContactClose.astro';
import { services } from '../data/services';
---
<Layout title="Implementation & Client Delivery Services — Cosmin Ghinoiu" description="Embedded contract delivery and defined projects: implementation, migration, configuration, rollout recovery, enablement and operational handover." current="/services/">
  <section class="page-intro section-wrap"><h1>Responsibility where <br />the work needs it.</h1><p class="lead">I can lead implementation and client delivery within your team on contract, or take on a defined project. These are four situations where I can help.</p><nav class="page-index" aria-label="Service situations">{services.map(service => <a href={'#' + service.id}>{service.title}<Arrow /></a>)}</nav></section>
  <div class="section-wrap service-details">{services.map(service => <section class="service-detail" id={service.id} aria-labelledby={service.id + '-heading'}><div><h2 id={service.id + '-heading'}>{service.title}</h2><p>{service.situation}</p><a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Discuss this situation <Arrow /></a></div><div class="service-body"><h3>What I take on</h3><p>{service.responsibility}</p><h3>The work may include</h3><ul class="plain-list">{service.outputs.map(output => <li>{output}</li>)}</ul><a class="service-proof" href={service.href}><span>{service.proofTitle}</span><p>{service.proof}</p><span class="text-link">Read the example <Arrow direction="up-right" /></span></a></div></section>)}</div>
  <section class="engagement engagement-tint section-wrap"><h2>Scope around <br />the situation.</h2><div><p>For embedded work, we agree the delivery responsibilities and how I work with your existing teams. For a defined project, we agree the outputs, dependencies and handover.</p><p>A role description or a short project outline is enough to begin that conversation.</p></div></section>
  <ContactClose />
</Layout>
